#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: rezervo.php
msgid "Rezervo - Pre-Orders for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Plogins Vorbestellung, Vorbestellungen für WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: rezervo.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-preorder/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: rezervo.php
msgid ""
"Let customers pre-order upcoming or out-of-stock WooCommerce products with a "
"custom add-to-cart button."
msgstr ""
"Ermögliche Kunden, bevorstehende oder nicht mehr vorrätige WooCommerce-"
"Produkte mit einer benutzerdefinierten Schaltfläche zum Hinzufügen zum "
"Warenkorb vorzubestellen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: rezervo.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: rezervo.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr ""

#: rezervo.php:48
msgid "Rezervo requires WooCommerce to be active."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:32 src/Service/PreorderService.php:258
#: src/Service/PreorderService.php:280
msgid "Pre-order"
msgstr "Vorbestellung"

#: src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:33
msgid ""
"Sell this product as a pre-order. It stays purchasable even when out of "
"stock."
msgstr ""
"Verkaufe dieses Produkt als Vorbestellung. Es bleibt käuflich, auch wenn es "
"nicht vorrätig ist."

#: src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:38
msgid "Expected release date"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:39
msgid ""
"Optional. Shown on the product page and used by add-ons for release "
"notifications."
msgstr ""

